# Imported maps, and the Python bytecode of the importer.
#
# `maps/imported/<id>/` is DERIVED: tools/bsp_import.py regenerates all of it from
# the .bsp in one pass of about four seconds, so committing it buys nothing and costs
# 14 MB for two maps. The stronger reason is that those bytes are somebody else's map.
# Reading a third-party .bsp for its dimensions and its ramp angles is what
# godot/inspirations/ is for, in the shape godot/../external-study/ already has;
# redistributing its geometry in this repository is a different act and wants the
# author's permission. The generated <id>.gd and <id>.tscn live INSIDE that directory
# rather than beside the hand-written maps, so this stays one line and never becomes a
# list of map names to keep in step -- which is this tree's most repeated bug.
#
# They live in the airdrift-maps repository (../airdrift-maps; the bootstrap-link lines keep its old directory name, which bootstrap leaves as a link, so a box bootstrapped before the rename still resolves them), and gs-bootstrap links them here off the
# comment line below (copies them, on Windows by default).
# bootstrap-link: airdrift-maps/maps
/maps/imported
/tools/__pycache__/
screenshots/
/addons/gs_spectate
/addons/gs_effects
/addons/gs_settings
/addons/gs_menu
/addons/gs_audio
/addons/gs_fx
/addons/gs_console
/addons/gs_peer_to_peer
/addons/gs_physics
/addons/gs_spawn
/addons/gs_player
/addons/gs_player_controller
/addons/gs_player_char
/addons/gs_animation
/addons/gs_save
/addons/gs_camera
/addons/gs_player_class
/addons/gs_team
/addons/gs_lighting
/addons/gs_bot

# One-off debug scenes a session leaves at the root.
/_scratch_*
# Maps a player copies in by hand (gs-map GSMapLocalMaps); no leading slash, because hv reads `/addons/<name>` lines as links.
addons/maps/
/addons/gs_sql

# Converted worlds (gs-map regen, `airdrift_global_worlds`) and the art stores they name (licence.pbr_store ../pbr-library): links to airdrift-maps.
# bootstrap-link: airdrift-maps/worlds
/worlds
/pbr-library
/model-library
/addons/gs_bot_record
/addons/godot-sqlite
